<http://data.silknow.org/object/85c85a52-b87b-3d80-91e1-a391167ab41f>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Man’s night cap made of bleached linen twill, embroidered with green and purple silk floss and silver filé, in a pattern of pansies.  The cap is cut in one piece with a brim and 4 shaped sections, and lined with coarse linen. The brim is trimmed with bobbin lace of silver-gilt filé and strip, with a knot of lace at the crown."@en , "M, 1680-99, French; linen twill embroidered with silk & silver thread embroidery, silver-gilt lace"@en ;
